    },
    "body": "**Fixes a delivery mistake of mine:** the memory-result PR [#2177](https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/pull/2177) merged with the **previous** cycle's record in place of the one its title, body and validation comment describe, because my delivery script copied the round's earlier file. This restores the correct record at `docs/labs/addressed-memory-2026-10-10/README.md`: the device fix measured at **0.19 s/step against 7.4 s/step on CPU**, the two-seed run at D10's own recipe reading **19/40** and **19/40** against the brief's **27/40** bar with G1's float BPB **1.20184** against the anchor's **1.17425**, the **REJECT for this configuration with the mechanism open**, and the half-steps development reading (**22/40**, wrong-value **11**) with the step-matched control it names as the next piece.\n\nDocs only: one file, no source, criterion or panel changes. `python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py` passes at this head. References #2029",
